<title>UK: CLF Hypo sets 250 million mark nine-year FRN.</title>
<headline>CLF Hypo sets 250 million mark nine-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Deutsche Bank Frankfurt.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CLF HYPOTHEKENBANK BERLIN AG</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN DEM   SPREAD     FLAT	MATURITY    28.NOV.05</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 3M LIBOR  PAY DATE    28.NOV.96</p>
<p> ISS PRICE  100.14    FULL FEES  20 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    BERLIN    DENOMS (K) ONE	 GOV LAW    GERMAN</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
